Bind Npc 24424 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 14424 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 317 "Ascetic"
    Journal for karus "I promised to bring the Eslant [Ascetic] the 7th voucher of asceticism."
    Journal for elmorad "I promised to bring the Eslant [Ascetic] the 7th voucher of asceticism."
    Give 1 of 910127000 on accept
    Collect 1 of 910134000

Requires player level >= 62

Rewards
    Give 1 of 910139000
    Give 1 of 910140000
    Give 1 of 910141000
    Give 1 of 910142000

direction_454 = location "[Watchman of Suffering] Chatsra" about "[Watchman of Suffering] Chatsra\nUndertaker of the first suffering" found "Eslant" at 100 100 in zone 11
direction_461 = location "[Watchman of Suffering] Teppa" about "[Watchman of Suffering] Teppa\nUndertaker of the first suffering" found "Eslant" at 100 100 in zone 12

On available
    Say "Master! Let's go to find the Undertaker of Suffering~"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Show quest "I express my respect to you who have come far and wide after great adversity \n You still have a long way to go but I will give you the item below if you collect the certificates of the sufferings you've underwent \nWill you proceed?"

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        If player lacks 910127000 and player lacks 910134000
            Say "I will give you another written order. Bring me the seventh certificate of suffering"
            Topic "Confirm" do
                Transaction
                    Give 1 of 910127000
            Topic "Where can I find it?" do
                Map direction_454
        Else
            Say "Brave warrior!! Where is the seventh certificate of suffering? You must bring the seventh certificate of suffering in order to complete the mission."
            Topic "Where can I find it?" do
                Map direction_454
    If player is elmorad
        If player lacks 910127000 and player lacks 910134000
            Say "I will give you another written order. Bring me the seventh certificate of suffering"
            Topic "Confirm" do
                Transaction
                    Give 1 of 910127000
            Topic "Where can I find it?" do
                Map direction_461
        Else
            Say "Brave warrior!! Where is the seventh certificate of suffering? You must bring the seventh certificate of suffering in order to complete the mission."
            Topic "Where can I find it?" do
                Map direction_461

On claimable
    Show quest "Did you bring the seventh certificate of suffering? I will award you the item below if you give it to me."
